# Pixel-7 (panther / Tensor-G2 / Android 14) build.prop overlay
# Source: reference profile pinned in agents/orchestrator/EXPERIMENTS.md
# (panther:14/UQ1A.240205.004) and agents/stability/stack/layers.md.
# Magisk auto-mirrors this file over /system/build.prop at late_start.
# service.sh additionally re-applies each prop via `resetprop --persist`
# so the values survive process-level getprop calls that bypass build.prop.
